    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>AlloFiber is osteoinductive, osteoconductive, and osteogenic when hydrated with patient’s BMA<sup>1</sup></p>\n<p>It is comprised of 100% cortical bone with no added carriers and is processed to preserve endogenous growth factors, such as BMP’s, PDGF-BB, and others<sup>2</sup></p>\n",
